♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:31,090
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:34,190
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:37,620
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:43,030
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,010
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:49,260
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,560
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,450
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

11
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:55,113
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:55,113 --> 00:00:55,900
=Episode 26=

13
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:13,280
You must be Lu Mingye,
Wanwei's daughter.

14
00:01:16,359 --> 00:01:17,319
Hello, Ma'am.

15
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:18,640
So alike.

16
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:20,280
You really are so alike.

17
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:21,680
Those eyes...

18
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,480
Just like your mom

19
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,799
when she was young.

20
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,920
Ma'am, you must be tired from the trip.

21
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:33,280
Seeing you, sweetie,

22
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,840
makes it all worthwhile.

23
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:35,760
Come on.

24
00:01:36,439 --> 00:01:37,359
Sit by me.

25
00:01:38,319 --> 00:01:39,000
Thanks, Ma'am.

26
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:43,959
Sit.

27
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,879
Let's have some tea

28
00:01:46,519 --> 00:01:47,359
and catch up.

29
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:48,959
I booked a restaurant.

30
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:50,799
We'll eat there together.

31
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:51,959
Okay.

32
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:00,640
Just the three of us?

33
00:02:01,359 --> 00:02:01,959
Who else?

34
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,359
Were you expecting someone?

35
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:06,120
No, this is nice.

36
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,719
Have some tea.

37
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,280
Thanks.

38
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:17,159
I'm happy and sad today.

39
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,000
With you beside me,

40
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:20,960
I feel young again,

41
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:23,560
like the days
when I sat and chatted with your mother.

42
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:26,400
Ma'am.

43
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:28,599
Could you tell me

44
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,719
about my mom in her younger days?

45
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,879
It's such a shame.

46
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:35,639
Back then,

47
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,560
your mom and I were just one step away.

48
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:40,639
We could've reunited in Xizi City.

49
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:42,439
We'd even agreed

50
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:44,960
to spend Chinese New Year's together.

51
00:02:46,719 --> 00:02:47,759
You mean

52
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,919
the last time you spoke

53
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:51,280
was on New Year's Eve?

54
00:02:51,639 --> 00:02:52,120
Yes.

55
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,840
It was the last day of that year.

56
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:55,560
I remember it well.

57
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:59,639
My parents' accident
was on New Year's Eve.

58
00:03:00,639 --> 00:03:01,360
Ma'am.

59
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:02,840
Do you remember

60
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,719
how you and my mom made those plans?

61
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:06,840
We...

62
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:10,400
We agreed over the phone

63
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,479
to meet that night

64
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:14,319
at an old restaurant in Xizi City.

65
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,199
But then...

66
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:17,280
Your mom's phone went dead.

67
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,479
I waited half the night,
but they never showed.

68
00:03:19,759 --> 00:03:21,520
Did you ever go look for her after that?

69
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:27,319
The next day, I went to the Lu house.

70
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:30,520
But they told me,

71
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,280
your parents had an emergency

72
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,599
and had to leave Xizi City.

73
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:34,919
No set return date.

74
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,080
I had to return to Xiangjiang

75
00:03:38,159 --> 00:03:40,800
with Xiuming's father to handle
arrangements for going abroad.

76
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:42,439
So I left in a rush.

77
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,639
Ma'am.

78
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,599
Please think carefully.

79
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:52,520
When you spoke to my mom on the phone,

80
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:54,360
did she say anything else?

81
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:56,680
I remember now.

82
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,000
Your mom said on the phone,

83
00:03:59,199 --> 00:04:01,560
their car broke down on the road.

84
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:03,680
So they were

85
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,280
fixing the car at Shunfa Auto Shop.

86
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,560
They'd come meet me
as soon as it was fixed.

87
00:04:09,759 --> 00:04:10,560
Auto shop?

88
00:04:11,879 --> 00:04:13,120
Shunfa Auto Shop.

89
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,079
I've sent people to check that shop.

90
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:21,519
We'll know in a few days.

91
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,680
Hope this leads somewhere.

92
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,079
(Mingyu!)

93
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:32,480
(I just heard that woman)

94
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,639
(called that older lady "Mom" too!)

95
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,079
What's going on?

96
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,120
Did you just realize

97
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,959
you can't take your eyes off me?

98
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,600
When I look closely,

99
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,759
you have pretty good features.

100
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:11,079
Nice bone structure.

101
00:05:12,079 --> 00:05:14,480
Not a thing wrong with your face.

102
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:17,079
If you had a sister,

103
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:18,759
she'd be gorgeous, too.

104
00:05:19,519 --> 00:05:21,040
Mom wasn't meant to have a daughter.

105
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:23,279
Just me and my brother.

106
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,879
Did you pick up your mom
at the airport alone?

107
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,319
At first, yes.

108
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:40,480
Then...

109
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,600
Xia Lingshan found out and told me

110
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,319
she was nearby,

111
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:46,439
so she came over.

112
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:51,920
Hey, Mom.

113
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,519
(I got to Lingshan's place safely.)

114
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,560
Then get some rest.

115
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,040
(Okay.)

116
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:03,759
Is your mom close with Miss Xia?

117
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,560
They're

118
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:07,839
close indeed.

119
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,240
They're practically

120
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:11,360
like mother and daughter.

121
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:16,160
Oh, right.

122
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,640
(Marriage Agreement)

123
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:35,960
(Marriage Agreement)

124
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:53,279
Since you know about Lingshan and me,

125
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:55,639
let's end our deal early, then.

126
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:56,959
She and I

127
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:58,399
are getting engaged.

128
00:07:01,017 --> 00:07:03,830
(Marriage Agreement;
Duan Xiuming & Lu Mingye)

129
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,959
That's good.

130
00:07:14,199 --> 00:07:14,920
Congratulations.

131
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:17,720
Let's get divorced tomorrow.

132
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:19,920
I won't get in the way of you two.

133
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,160
I'm sorry, Mingyu.

134
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:26,040
We were never meant to be together.

135
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,319
Hello?

136
00:07:37,519 --> 00:07:38,319
Duan Xiuming!

137
00:07:38,639 --> 00:07:39,639
I actually thought

138
00:07:39,639 --> 00:07:41,199
you were the most devoted man alive.

139
00:07:41,519 --> 00:07:42,439
- What's wrong?
- I never thought...

140
00:07:42,439 --> 00:07:44,160
You're just a two-timing jerk.

141
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:44,839
It's fine.

142
00:07:45,439 --> 00:07:46,160
One sec.

143
00:07:51,439 --> 00:07:52,680
What do you mean, two-timing?

144
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,079
Don't play dumb.

145
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,279
I saw you at the airport.

146
00:07:56,519 --> 00:07:58,439
You were there with a woman.

147
00:07:58,439 --> 00:08:00,199
Mingye held me back, or you're dead.

148
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,199
Wait.

149
00:08:01,879 --> 00:08:04,040
Mingye knows about this?

150
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:05,199
What?

151
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,519
Now you're panicking?

152
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:08,800
Let me tell you.

153
00:08:08,959 --> 00:08:10,160
I didn't just see it.

154
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:12,079
I took a photo and sent it to Mingye.

155
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,800
Solid proof.

156
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,000
Just the three of us?

157
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,000
Who else

158
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,079
did you expect?

159
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:21,879
Xu Suyue.

160
00:08:22,319 --> 00:08:23,040
Thanks a lot.

161
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:24,839
When Mingye and I get married,

162
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,240
you must sit at the head table.

163
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,160
What...?

164
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:49,200
Our deal ends in three days.

165
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,279
What if we...?

166
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,519
I'll give you two options.

167
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,480
One, renew it.

168
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,960
Two, void it.

169
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,159
Make it permanent.

170
00:09:08,355 --> 00:09:10,928
♪Soft look hides the fire deep inside♪

171
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,679
Lu Mingye.

172
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:14,073
♪Gentle smile never tells my fight♪

173
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,559
Don't tell me that during our deal,

174
00:09:15,559 --> 00:09:18,039
you fell head over heels for me again.

175
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:20,066
♪I keep my calm, hide all my soul♪

176
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,120
So confident, huh?

177
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:24,000
Maybe I wasn't so sure before.

178
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:26,120
But now I'm absolutely sure.

179
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:27,559
Lu Mingye.

180
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,159
You're crazy about me.

181
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:31,439
♪I walk alone with silent defiance♪

182
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,480
So what if I am?

183
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,000
You're mine.

184
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,260
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

185
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:39,853
♪My own salvation I believe♪

186
00:09:40,062 --> 00:09:42,548
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

187
00:09:42,709 --> 00:09:46,036
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

188
00:09:46,583 --> 00:09:48,856
♪Endure the cold, endure the bias♪

189
00:09:49,729 --> 00:09:52,069
♪Hide my wit behind quiet eyes♪

190
00:09:52,235 --> 00:09:55,002
♪Step by step close to the target line♪

191
00:09:55,064 --> 00:09:57,011
♪All the injustice I will redefine♪

192
00:09:57,039 --> 00:09:58,919
Are you always this bossy
when you're jealous?

193
00:09:58,919 --> 00:10:00,600
♪Never lean on anyone's light♪

194
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,360
Lu Mingye.

195
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:02,840
Let me make this clear.

196
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:05,799
From the moment you signed this,

197
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:08,440
I never intended
to let it be canceled or voided.

198
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:11,000
♪Waiting for the moment to rewrite time♪

199
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,720
There's nothing
between Xia Lingshan and me.

200
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,679
In my heart...

201
00:10:15,679 --> 00:10:17,240
♪Don't beg for mercy,
don't bow down freely♪

202
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,159
there's only you.

203
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:20,552
♪Wisdom sharp like blade unseen♪

204
00:10:20,895 --> 00:10:23,634
♪I hold my fate within my hand clean♪

205
00:10:23,687 --> 00:10:26,187
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

206
00:10:26,259 --> 00:10:29,572
♪My own salvation I believe♪

207
00:10:29,841 --> 00:10:32,254
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

208
00:10:32,361 --> 00:10:35,241
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

209
00:10:35,453 --> 00:10:38,360
♪I'm a good girl but not naive♪

210
00:10:38,843 --> 00:10:41,583
♪Power hidden underneath♪

211
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:44,139
♪Fight my way, rise from the grief♪

212
00:10:44,248 --> 00:10:47,928
♪Rule my world, set myself free♪

213
00:10:48,048 --> 00:10:50,689
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

214
00:10:50,817 --> 00:10:54,243
♪My own salvation I believe♪

215
00:10:54,551 --> 00:10:57,237
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

216
00:10:57,324 --> 00:11:00,391
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

217
00:11:35,608 --> 00:11:40,228
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

218
00:11:42,688 --> 00:11:46,608
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

219
00:11:49,708 --> 00:11:54,398
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

220
00:11:55,518 --> 00:12:00,468
♪Chimes and cicadas
have been in love for so long♪

221
00:12:02,858 --> 00:12:09,038
♪A love letter written in song♪

222
00:12:09,738 --> 00:12:14,548
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

223
00:12:17,058 --> 00:12:22,988
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

224
00:12:23,758 --> 00:12:29,778
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

225
00:12:30,038 --> 00:12:36,958
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

226
00:12:37,918 --> 00:12:40,448
♪Close your eyes and count♪

227
00:12:40,488 --> 00:12:43,088
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

228
00:12:43,088 --> 00:12:49,588
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
